WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.230
Today is three short words. In each one, a letter says its own name.

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:07.260
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.430
Say the first word. Go.

4
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.755
The last letter is the heart part. It says its own name.

5
00:00:14.205 --> 00:00:15.187
The word is go.

6
00:00:15.887 --> 00:00:17.340
The second word. No.

7
00:00:18.639 --> 00:00:19.505
As in nest.

8
00:00:20.105 --> 00:00:20.918
It says no.

9
00:00:21.618 --> 00:00:27.547
The third word is a single letter. It says its own name too, and as a word it is always a capital.

10
00:00:28.347 --> 00:00:34.201
Your child may notice that yesterday's words did the same thing. Say yes. That is the idea.

11
00:00:34.651 --> 00:00:38.350
Then step away. For job two, press play on the sound track.

12
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:42.907
Job three brings back yesterday's four words, and two from day four.
